# Server: /track_object  (owner: navigation, RPi)
# Camera-guided approach: drive using the onboard camera's view of the object until
# the robot is `stop_distance` from it (front edge to object) and facing it.
string object_name
# metres from the robot's front edge to the object; <= 0 -> the server's default
float32 stop_distance
---
bool success
string message
---
string status
